  "result": "Perfect! All 128 tests pass. I've successfully added voucher support to invoices:\n\n**Added to src/errors.js:**\n- VOUCHER_EXISTS: \"An invoice can only have one voucher.\"\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n\n1. **applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })** function:\n   - Only works on draft invoices (returns NOT_DRAFT if not draft)\n   - Prevents multiple vouchers per invoice (returns VOUCHER_EXISTS if one exists)\n   - Validates amount is a positive integer (returns AMOUNT_INVALID if invalid)\n   - Stores { code, amount } in invoice.voucher\n   - Returns ok(newInvoice) on success\n   - Does not mutate original invoice\n\n2. **Updated invoiceTotals** to include vouchers:\n   - Returns voucher amount (0 if none applied)\n   - Calculates: total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n   - Clamps total to 0 (never goes negative)\n   - Formula: fixed amount off after VAT\n\n**Tests cover:**\n- Applying a voucher to draft invoice\n- Voucher included in totals calculation\n- Rejection of voucher on non-draft invoices\n- Prevention of duplicate vouchers\n- Validation of amount parameter\n- Voucher returns 0 when not applied\n- No mutation of original invoice\n\nAll 128 tests pass successfully!",
